  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">El cantante Manuel Carrasco lleg&oacute; al Teatro M&oacute;naco de Onda, llen&oacute; y convenci&oacute;, en el concierto ac&uacute;stico de su gira &#39;Confieso que he sentido&#39; de la noche de este viernes, dentro de los actos de la III Seman Cultural. Tanto es as&iacute; que en dos ocasiones una parte del p&uacute;blico (mayoritariamente mujeres) se ha puesto a bailar a los pies del escenario.</span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerrtmanuelcarrascomonaco160514/img_0436.jpg\" alt=\"img_0436\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerrtmanuelcarrascomonaco160514/img_0437.jpg\" alt=\"img_0437\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerrtmanuelcarrascomonaco160514/img_0438.jpg\" alt=\"img_0438\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerrtmanuelcarrascomonaco160514/img_0439.jpg\" alt=\"img_0439\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerrtmanuelcarrascomonaco160514/img_0440.jpg\" alt=\"img_0440\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerrtmanuelcarrascomonaco160514/img_0441.jpg\" alt=\"img_0441\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerrtmanuelcarrascomonaco160514/img_0443.jpg\" alt=\"img_0443\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerrtmanuelcarrascomonaco160514/img_0444.jpg\" alt=\"img_0444\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d